## What was built

The following deliverables were completed for the Lumen landing page:

- **Hero Section** — Top-of-page region with headline, supporting subheadline, and primary CTA button. Styled with Inter typeface, accessible sizing, polished gradient background, and responsive layout for desktop and mobile.

- **Features Section** — Mid-page grid of 6 feature cards, each with icon, title, and description. Three-column layout on desktop, single column on mobile, with a polished gradient backdrop and professional typography.

- **Contact Form Section** — Bottom section with labelled input fields (name, email, message), client-side validation with accessible error messages, and submit handler. Gracefully falls back to `mailto:` when the backend endpoint is unavailable.

- **Production Deployment Guide** — Instructions for deploying to static-file hosts (GitHub Pages, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, S3 + CloudFront, nginx) with build-free workflow and optional backend handler integration.

- **Complete README** — Canonical entry point documenting prerequisites, local run steps, project structure, and completed deliverables.